# Generated by `node tools/polestar.js profession draft Enchanting --out` from Forever's client tables. Do not edit: rebuild with that command.
guide forever/professions/enchanting
title Enchanting 1-300
category Professions
levels 5-60
zone Azeroth

# Data:
# The Forever client's tables (recipes, skill thresholds, reagents, vendor
# prices) via wago.tools, with Classic Era filling the few spells and items
# they lack; pfQuest (vendors, drops, nodes) and a curated trainer list
# checked against npcs.json. Forever changed many thresholds, reagents and
# names from Classic, so Classic recipe tables do not apply.
#
# Trainers and vendors are smart targets: the engine sends each character to
# the nearest one of its faction. Farming spots are picked per faction.
#
# Recipe choice: cheapest expected cost to 300 (Classic skill-up chances:
# certain while orange, falling from yellow to grey), with gathered materials
# valued at 4x their vendor sell price; see tools/lib/professions/plan.js.
# Material counts are expected values; yellow and green crafts can take more.
#
# Route:
#     1-25  Enchant Bracer - Inferior Stamina (about 31)
#    25-75  Enchant Bracer - Minor Deflect (about 50)
#    75-90  Enchant Bracer - Minor Deflect (about 17)
#    90-120 Enchant Chest - Minor Absorption (about 54)
#   120-130 Enchant Weapon - Minor Striking (about 12)
#   130-150 Enchant Cloak - Minor Agility (about 24)
#   150-155 Enchant Cloak - Lesser Fire Resistance (about 6)
#   155-180 Enchant Bracer - Lesser Stamina (about 39)
#   180-200 Enchant Boots - Lesser Agility (about 28)
#   200-225 Enchant Bracer - Strength (about 39)
#   225-255 Enchant Cloak - Greater Defense (about 54)
#   255-292 Enchant Boots - Agility (about 98)
#   292-300 Enchant Gloves - Minor Haste (about 23)

step Apprentice Enchanting
  tip Enchanting runs alongside leveling. Forever's Legacy System rewards crafting professions at skill 150, 225 and 300 (the Journeyman, Expert and Artisan caps), so each of those checkpoints counts. Materials for 1-75 are worth about 4g 3s in all.
  train Enchanting Apprentice
  skill Enchanting 1
  buy 6217 x1 nearest
  buy 10938 x50 nearest
  buy 247786 x32 nearest

step Enchant Bracer - Inferior Stamina to 25
  tip Orange (a point every craft) until 20, yellow until 22, green until 25. Enchant your own gear: any item for that slot will do.
  craft 7421 x1 -- a tool: keep it in your bags
  craft 7418 until 25

step Enchant Bracer - Minor Deflect to 75
  tip Orange (a point every craft) until 80, yellow until 100, green until 120. Enchant your own gear: any item for that slot will do. 75 is the Apprentice cap.
  craft 7428 until 75
  skill Enchanting 75

step Journeyman Enchanting
  tip Journeyman needs character level 10 and Enchanting 50; it raises the cap to 150. Materials for 75-150 are worth about 7g 51s in all.
  level 10
  train Enchanting Journeyman
  buy 10938 x87 nearest
  buy 10940 x15 nearest

step Formula: Enchant Cloak - Minor Agility
  tip Teaches Enchant Cloak - Minor Agility (needs Enchanting 110). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too.
  buy 11039 nearest

step Shadowgem (Alliance)
  only Alliance
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Shadowgem comes from Copper Vein nodes (Mining); this is the densest cluster in the data. The Auction House works too.
  collect 1210 x1 @70.4,55.1 era

